{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近日一名樓主在Threads分享，3年前於香港荷里活廣場遺失的AirPods，竟透過「尋找」功能追蹤至加拿大萬 …</p><p></p>\n<p>近日一名樓主在Threads分享，3年前於香港荷里活廣場遺失的AirPods，竟透過「尋找」功能追蹤至加拿大萬錦市，帖文隨即掀起跨地域尋物熱話。當他感嘆親身赴加便會取回耳機後，多名熱心網民竟把一句戲言變成真實行動。</p>\n<h2>三年前荷里活廣場失物遠走加拿大</h2>\n<p>樓主憶述，AirPods當年在荷里活廣場不翼而飛，其後一直透過Apple「尋找」功能留意位置，發現耳機由香港新蒲崗出發，最終遠赴加拿大。他在帖文寫道：「Ho crazy，當年係荷里活廣場唔見咗，然後一直睇住佢由新蒲崗出發去加拿大。」事隔3年，裝置仍顯示位於萬錦市，樓主發文感嘆：「咁就3年啦，如果俾我去到加拿大我會搵返你出嚟 」，離奇旅程令大批網民關注。</p>\n<h2>現任持有人解釋二手店購入</h2>\n<p>帖文曝光後，多名鄰近萬錦市的網民及居加港人留言表示願意協助，數名熱心朋友其後更親身前往定位地址，與屋內一對老華僑夫婦溝通。持有AirPods的夫婦堅稱耳機並非拾獲，而是從二手店購入，因此一直不知道裝置屬於失物；協助拍門的網民轉述，二人「堅持唔係執返嚟，係喺二手店買返嚟」。</p>\n<h2>熱心港人拍門取回失蹤耳機</h2>\n<p>經過溝通後，現任持有人願意把AirPods交給登門協助的熱心網民，再由對方代為轉交樓主。由香港遺失、途經新蒲崗，再流轉至加拿大萬錦市，這副失蹤3年的耳機最終靠網上動員尋回；至於它如何進入二手店，現還未有解答，整段跨國旅程仍留下未解部分。</p>\n<h2>網民震驚效率狂讚無名英雄</h2>\n<p>事件結局令網民嘩然，不少人直呼見證奇蹟，有留言驚嘆：「出po 11小時拎得返3年前被偷嘅物品！香港人係咪痴線㗎！咁有愛！」亦有人笑言「呢個勇敢事蹟要寫落CV」、「師兄可以爭做下年傑出青年」，並大讚「唔係所有英雄都著披風，respect！」另有網民表示「樓主未上返水你哋就已經拎返」及「見證奇蹟，真係搵得返」，將焦點放在熱心港人的驚人行動力。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132465536471_7800155326aeaee4e48604.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"885294814_17970481626194280_4222275093605808592_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132465536471_7800155326aeaee4e48604.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>成功尋回Airpods（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132851821777_4160581666aeaee511c679.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_7361.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132851821777_4160581666aeaee511c679.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>樓主發文感嘆已遺失Airpods三年（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132982642739_567997756aeaee5328f0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"06e0593e-ff10-4437-ad67-4a81c91b5ae2.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378132982642739_567997756aeaee5328f0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大批網民自告奮勇表示願意協助取回（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133236441733_9655049506aeaee5545ed0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"887092264_17972598270189964_48500499034292313_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133236441733_9655049506aeaee5545ed0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民行動力超強（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937813357416393_17434098936aeaee588b3be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1cb1e1ae-9405-41ff-abc5-450d507601db.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937813357416393_17434098936aeaee588b3be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民成功取回（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133755651799_2005105976aeaee5a1e318.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"d578a6b2-c590-4c6b-8411-868434b27988.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133755651799_2005105976aeaee5a1e318.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>熱心網友分享經過（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133871254224_8903898786aeaee5b72126.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"814949a0-93af-4504-a2ab-e3cdf1c48dfe.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378133871254224_8903898786aeaee5b72126.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民大讚該名熱心網友（圖片來源：threads@karifier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p> </p>\n<p>在 Threads 查看</p>\n<p> </p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/airpods%e5%b0%8b%e7%89%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AirPods尋物</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%a0%e6%8b%bf%e5%a4%a7%e6%b8%af%e4%ba%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">加拿大港人</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊熱話</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:44.155483+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1127,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:57.399617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:55.554686+00:00","content_hash":"520f84a581e6cbfa3ea5f5e6883413eebd4d4c803454e7b5d1a13705050052bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}